WEBVTT

00:12:57.746 --> 00:13:00.329
we can move forward
with our eyes wide open.

00:13:00.353 --> 00:13:02.677
We can ask the difficult
questions up front,

00:13:02.701 --> 00:13:05.741
we can put in place
the necessary safeguards

00:13:05.765 --> 00:13:08.562
and, as part of that,
we'll have to think about our ethics.

00:13:08.586 --> 00:13:11.758
We'll have to think about putting bounds
on the implementation

00:13:11.782 --> 00:13:13.280
of biological function.

00:13:13.604 --> 00:13:17.319
So as part of this, research in bioethics
will have to be a priority.

00:13:17.343 --> 00:13:19.750
It can't be relegated to second place

00:13:19.774 --> 00:13:22.288
in the excitement
of scientific innovation.

00:13:23.154 --> 00:13:26.628
But the ultimate prize,
the ultimate destination on this journey,

00:13:26.652 --> 00:13:30.096
would be breakthrough applications
and breakthrough industries